  Tab             cycle panes       Shift+R         refresh            ,               settings
  ?               help              Shift+T         tour               Shift+D         sync status
  !               next asking       Shift+F         next failing       Shift+Arrows    resize splitters
  q q             quit              Enter           open               w               work on this
  c / x / u       spawn agent       s               shell              e               editor
  m               mark read         z               snooze             Shift+N         new project
  n               new workspace     Shift+M         merge PR           Shift+V         reviewers
  Shift+G         assignees         Shift+L         labels             Shift+O         open in browser
  r               reply             Shift+A         adopt sessions     Shift+J         join into PR
  Shift+X         archive           Enter           toggle section     →/←             expand/collapse
  d               description       Space           select row         z               undo mark-read
  Shift+PgUp/Dn   scroll            ]]              exit to sidebar    ]]<key>         snippets
